    {
      "component_id": "c_022",
      "class": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "Pregnancy is technically only possible during the five days before ovulation through to the day of ovulation. These six days are the \u2018fertile window\u2019 in a woman\u2019s cycle, and reflect the lifespan of sperm (5 days) and the lifespan of the ovum (24 hours).",
